Save a passage from an item as a highlight

Usage: mxr reading highlight [OPTIONS] <ITEM> <QUOTE>

Arguments:
  <ITEM>
  <QUOTE>

Options:
      --note <NOTE>
      --article                Taken from the fetched article rather than the issue
      --paragraph <PARAGRAPH>  The paragraph (counting from 0) the passage is in, so the highlight marks that one and not the first match
      --account <ACCOUNT>      Limit to one account; the default covers every account
      --format <FORMAT>        [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]
  -h, --help                   Print help
